:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Call Center Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Vacation Queen''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 2.3 Update|Version 2.3]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] She is a slower-attacking, stronger variant of [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] gives her [[Knockback|knockback]], a faster attack rate, increases her damage, range and speed and removes [[Multi-Hit]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]] she can be obtained when rolling in the gacha system after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 1.

