==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Vacation Queen was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Summer by the Sea (Removed Combo)|Summer by the Sea]].
*Office Lady Cat is one of the many units that were updated to have Multi-Hit attacks in [[Version 6.0 Update|version 6.0]].
*Judging by one of the Cat Combos being with [[Salaryman Cat (Rare Cat)|Salaryman Cat]], and being titled [[Nyanko, Inc. (Combo)|Nyanko, Inc.]], Call Center Cat and Salaryman Cat both work for the same company.
**Also, further pushing the theory, they both mention a strict boss in the description of their Evolved Forms.

